DESCRIPTION:Mother Goose Parade Day marks one parade in one city: the Mothe
 r Goose Parade\, first staged in El Cajon\, California in 1947 and traditi
 onally held on the Sunday before Thanksgiving. It is an unusual entry on a
 ny holiday calendar\, because the thing it commemorates may no longer exis
 t. The parade has not marched live since 2019\, and the association that r
 an it was described by El Cajon's city manager in 2023 as defunct.\n\nhttp
 s://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/mother-goose-parade-day/
